.TH SIMPLE_SHELL 1 "" "Simple Shell" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
simple_shell - a simple UNIX command interpreter

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./simple_shell

.SH DESCRIPTION
simple_shell reads commands from the user and executes them.

It works in interactive and non-interactive mode.

.SH USAGE
Run the shell with:

.nf
$ ./simple_shell
.fi

.SH BUILTINS
The shell supports built-in commands.

.SH EOF
Ctrl-D ends the shell.

